@startuml
title Tidrapporten - arkitektur för mejlutskick
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Användare" as User
cloud "Cloud Scheduler" as Scheduler
database "PostgreSQL\nmail_outbox och fakturastatus" as DB
cloud "Brevo SMTP" as Brevo

rectangle "Tidrapporten (en Cloud Run-tjänst)" {
    component "Autentisering" as Auth
    component "Fakturering" as Invoicing
    interface "QueueMail" as QueuePort
    component "MailQueueService" as QueueService
    component "JdbcMailOutbox" as Outbox

    component "POST /internal/mail/dispatch" as Endpoint
    component "POST /internal/mail/cleanup" as CleanupEndpoint
    component "LocalMailDispatcher\n(dev: var 5:e sekund)" as LocalScheduler
    component "LocalMailCleanup\n(dev: dagligen 03:00)" as LocalCleanup
    component "MailDispatchService" as Dispatcher
    component "MailCleanupService" as Cleaner
    interface "MailTransport" as TransportPort
    component "QuarkusMailTransport" as SmtpAdapter
    component "InvoiceMailDeliveryEvents" as DeliveryEvents
}

User --> Auth : verifiering / återställning
User --> Invoicing : fakturamejl
Auth --> QueuePort
Invoicing --> QueuePort
QueuePort --> QueueService
QueueService --> Outbox : enqueue
Outbox <--> DB : krypterat innehåll\nclaim / finish

Scheduler --> Endpoint : varje minut + token
Scheduler --> CleanupEndpoint : dagligen + token
Endpoint --> Dispatcher : dispatch
CleanupEndpoint --> Cleaner : clean
LocalScheduler --> Dispatcher : dispatch
LocalCleanup --> Cleaner : clean
Dispatcher --> Outbox : claim / finish
Cleaner --> Outbox : ta bort avslutade > 60 dagar
Dispatcher --> TransportPort : send
TransportPort --> SmtpAdapter
SmtpAdapter --> Brevo : SMTP
Dispatcher --> DeliveryEvents : slutlig fakturastatus
DeliveryEvents --> DB : uppdatera leveransstatus

note bottom of DB
  Mejlinnehåll krypteras med AES-256-GCM.
  Innehållet rensas när en köpost får slutstatus.
end note
@enduml
